#.  7b9a7ec565505699f503b4fcf61500dceb36e744
#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man7/capabilities.7:1800
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The I</proc/PID/task/TID/status> file can be used to view the capability "
