#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man2/getpid.2:54
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The original Linux B<getuid>()  and B<geteuid>()  system calls supported "
#| "only 16-bit user IDs.  Subsequently, Linux 2.4 added B<getuid32>()  and "
